<title>NETHERLANDS: LABOUCHERE RATES VAN LEER A BUY.</title>
<headline>LABOUCHERE RATES VAN LEER A BUY.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summary of March 3 research.</p>
<p>Company---------Sector--------Price---Broker----------------</p>
<p>Van Leer	  Packaging     38.50   Labouchere</p>
<p>COMMENT: Buy. Company has global coverage in industrial</p>
<p>packaging, strong position in consumer niche markets. However</p>
<p>industrial packaging a mature market and standard products could</p>
<p>suffer from price pressure. Direct material costs a major factor</p>
<p>in earnings, but market appears to be exaggerating impact of raw</p>
<p>material price changes. Van Leer set to show greater consistency</p>
<p>of earnings growth than expected, justifying buy rating.</p>
<p>    Estimates (NLG):  EPS    P/E    P/CF   Dividend</p>
<p>    1995 (actual)     2.31   n/a    7.00   0.78</p>
<p>    1996		  2.91   11.9   7.92   0.96</p>
<p>    1997		  3.34   11.5   8.60   1.07</p>
